BOHOL’s snack and drink vending machine combines packaged snack channels, can and bottle positions, touchscreen browsing and configurable cashless payment. Buyers should provide actual package dimensions, product weight, target market, venue measurements and refill plan before the final cabinet, spiral layout, cooling configuration and software scope are approved.

The images show a branded reference design. Final dimensions, screen size, temperature range, payment hardware and product capacity are order-specific and should be confirmed in the production drawing and acceptance plan.
